<div class="auth shell">
  <aside class="auth-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow">Password help</p>
    <p class="auth-panel__display">Reset in person, at the office.</p>
    <p class="auth-panel__note">Staff check that the account belongs to you before they issue a temporary password.</p>
  </aside>

  <div class="auth-form">
    <div class="auth-form__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Password help</p>
      <h1 class="auth-form__title">Reset your password</h1>
      <p class="auth-form__sub">Password resets are handled at the CCIT office. Bring your student ID so staff can verify your account.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reset-steps">
      <h2 class="reset-steps__title">What to expect</h2>
      <ol class="reset-steps__list">
        <li>Visit the CCIT office during office hours, Monday to Friday, 08:00 to 17:00.</li>
        <li>Show your student ID at the counter.</li>
        <li>Staff verify your account and set a temporary password.</li>
        <li>Sign in with the temporary password, and ask staff for another reset if it does not work.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="reset-steps__note">For staff and office head accounts, the CCIT administrator handles the reset.</p>
    </div>

    <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="/login">Back to sign in</a>
  </div>
</div>
